<title>THAILAND: Dhana Siam Finance 1996 net profit drops.</title>
<headline>Dhana Siam Finance 1996 net profit drops.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consolidated financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				   Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		4.20	vs	     6.75</p>
<p>    Net		   1,076.29	vs	 1,421.10</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Dhana Siam Finance and Securities Plc.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
